{
  "id": "ss.terrain.ribcage",
  "name": "Ribcage (SS)",
  "description": "Salt Pan set dressing: what walked here before and did not leave. Seen from above: a spine along +x with six pairs of ribs raking back off it, longest in the middle, and a skull at the head end with two sockets, all bone over an ink contour. Blocking, and long: the game gives it a capsule with a spine (radius 10, half-spine 14) rather than a disc, the way it does the Mason Gland's slab, so a body slides along it instead of stopping a body's width off its face. The one prop on the pan that is not a mineral.",
